@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt
@customerToken = replace-with-customer-jwt
@guideToken = replace-with-assigned-guide-jwt
@scheduleId = 1
@participantId = 1
@registrationReference = replace-with-current-registration-uuid

### Public schedule list (bounded pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules?status=OPEN&page=0&size=20

### Create: use actual event/branch/guide IDs and future dates
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":1,"branchId":1,"guideId":1,"startDatetime":"2026-12-20T07:00:00+07:00","endDatetime":"2026-12-20T17:00:00+07:00","maxParticipants":20,"registrationClosesAt":"2026-12-19T17:00:00+07:00"}

### Register for self; copy participant ID and registrationReference from response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note":"Ăn chay"}

### Manual confirmation within hold expiry (not for tickets with Payment transactions)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/participants/{{participantId}}/manual-payment-confirmations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"registrationReference":"{{registrationReference}}","paymentReference":"BANK-RECEIPT-001"}

### Close registration before attendance
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CLOSED","changeReason":"Chốt danh sách bảo hiểm"}

### Only during the configured attendance window
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/participants/{{participantId}}/attendance
Authorization: Bearer {{guideToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CHECKED_IN"}

### Cancel before departure, before check-in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/participants/{{participantId}}/cancellations
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Không thể tham gia"}

### Participant audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/participants/{{participantId}}/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Durable reconciliation requests, not completed refunds
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule-payment-reviews?branchId=1&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### My tickets: principal from JWT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/participants?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Assigned guide schedules
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/guide-assignments?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{guideToken}}

### Capacity-only partial update (keep guide)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"maxParticipants":20}

### Unassign guide (keep capacity)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"guideId":null}

### Schedule audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Reschedule: noun resource, same validation/history
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/schedules/{{scheduleId}}/reschedulings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"newStartDatetime":"2026-12-21T07:00:00+07:00","newEndDatetime":"2026-12-21T17:00:00+07:00","changeReason":"Weather"}
